          <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1.75rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1), rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1)); border: 2px solid #eab308; border-radius: var(--radius-md); position: relative">
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -12px; right: 1.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eab308, #f97316); color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 900; padding: 0.25rem 0.875rem; border-radius: 9999px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.4)">
              🔥 编辑部强烈推荐 · 年度性价比神仙套餐
            </div>
            
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem">
