                  <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-main)">
                    <span style="color: #eab308">🔥 年付限时套餐</span>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 900; color: #eab308">¥89.00 / 年<br/><span style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-sub)">(折合 ¥7.41/月)</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 700">50GB / 月</td>
                  <td style="padding: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted)">年付订阅 (每30天重置)</td>
                  <td style="padding: 1rem"><span class="badge badge-amber" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eab308, #f97316); color: #fff">爆款！2.5Gbps专线 · 不限设备数</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 1rem; text-align: right">
                    <a href={brand.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.35rem 0.875rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eab308, #f97316)">抢购 ↗</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color)">
